Error [jet.UiServiceWithoutCapability]: UI host service `core.ui.host.clipboard.clear` needs `UI.Clipboard`.
  --> tests/ui/ui_clipboard_clear_without_capability.jet:14:23
    |
 14 |     _wiped: clipboard.clear()
    |                       ^^^^^
 Why: The typed host row crosses an operating-system service boundary, so every tier must receive the same explicit package capability instead of discovering permission at runtime. During `jet check`, Jet reports this diagnostic.
 Fix: Add `UI.Clipboard` to `authority.needs` in the package manifest, then rebuild.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2937
